<title>TURKEY: Bosphorus closed to traffic due to fog.</title>
<headline>Bosphorus closed to traffic due to fog.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The narrow Bosphorus strait was closed to northbound traffic since early morning due to fog over Istanbul, maritime officials said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Bosphorus has been closed since 3.30 a.m. (0130 GMT). Visibility is very low, about half a mile,&quot; said one official.</p>
